WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.313
Two explorers were in Waxcap Cave.

2
00:00:04.314 --> 00:00:06.809
The cave was dark and wet.

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.757
One explorer stepped in something slimy, and slipped. "Oof!"

4
00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:15.240
The other explorer caught her. "Be careful, Josie!"

5
00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:17.737
"Thanks, Penny!"

6
00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:25.659
Soon the explorers left the cave and walked through the woods.

7
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.927
"Here's our cabin," Penny said.

8
00:00:27.928 --> 00:00:32.539
"We'll get some rest and go back to the cave tomorrow."

9
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.667
"Ugh." Josie looked at her right boot.

10
00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:50.298
"There's slime all over my boot. I'll leave it outside."

11
00:00:50.299 --> 00:00:56.347
The next morning bright sunshine woke the explorers early.

12
00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:58.741
They heard a rustling noise outside.

13
00:00:58.742 --> 00:01:03.954
"What's that?" Penny asked.

14
00:01:03.955 --> 00:01:05.828
The two women hurried outside.

15
00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:08.367
A trash can lay on its side.

16
00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.310
A creature was sitting in the sun, eating trash.

17
00:01:11.311 --> 00:01:14.216
It looked like a giant mushroom.

18
00:01:14.217 --> 00:01:17.862
"Gorp! Gorp!" the mushroom monster said.

19
00:01:17.863 --> 00:01:21.112
"Hey, that's my boot!" Josie said.

20
00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:24.077
"It's stuck to that monster's head!"

21
00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:26.667
"Go away!" Penny yelled.

22
00:01:26.668 --> 00:01:31.314
"Gorp!" the mushroom monster said.

23
00:01:31.315 --> 00:01:33.454
Finally Josie kicked a can.

24
00:01:33.455 --> 00:01:39.011
Scared by the noise, the creature ran off.

25
00:01:39.012 --> 00:01:43.012
"Phew!" Josie said. "We got rid of it."

26
00:01:43.013 --> 00:01:46.000
"Yes, but . . ." Penny bit her lip.

27
00:01:46.001 --> 00:01:50.926
"What was that thing?"

28
00:01:50.927 --> 00:01:53.106
Mara wrinkled her nose.

29
00:01:53.107 --> 00:01:58.504
"Ew, Jack, that old, moldy sandwich is disgusting."

30
00:01:58.505 --> 00:02:02.338
"No, it isn't," Jack said. "It's science."

31
00:02:02.339 --> 00:02:04.255
Roxy and her friends were at school.

32
00:02:04.256 --> 00:02:07.842
They each had a life science project to share with the class.

33
00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:10.817
Mara was studying sea monkeys.

34
00:02:10.818 --> 00:02:13.311
Terrell was learning about birds.

35
00:02:13.312 --> 00:02:16.080
Roxy was growing bean sprouts.

36
00:02:16.081 --> 00:02:19.071
Jack had a sandwich covered in mold.

37
00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:22.807
Jack grinned. "I found this moldy sandwich under my bed.

38
00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:24.806
I knew it was perfect for my project.

39
00:02:24.807 --> 00:02:27.453
It shows mold's life cycle."

40
00:02:27.454 --> 00:02:30.258
"Mold is cool," Terrell said.

41
00:02:30.259 --> 00:02:32.887
"It's a fungus, just like mushrooms.

42
00:02:32.888 --> 00:02:36.221
Mold grows well in dark spaces."

43
00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.578
"Yeah, like under beds!" Jack grinned.

44
00:02:39.579 --> 00:02:43.632
"Do any types grow in sunlight?" Mara asked.

45
00:02:43.633 --> 00:02:47.415
Terrell shrugged. "I don't think so."

46
00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:49.713
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

47
00:02:49.714 --> 00:02:54.262
"I need to . . . um, add water to one of my plants."

48
00:02:54.263 --> 00:03:00.958
She hurried away.

49
00:03:00.959 --> 00:03:03.501
"Mayor Bloom, what is it?"

50
00:03:03.502 --> 00:03:06.410
"Some cave explorers saw a monster.

51
00:03:06.411 --> 00:03:10.910
It was in the woods by Waxcap Cave," Mayor Bloom said.

52
00:03:10.911 --> 00:03:14.291
"What did it look like?" Roxy asked.

53
00:03:14.292 --> 00:03:17.941
"Like a giant mushroom," Mayor Bloom said.

54
00:03:17.942 --> 00:03:19.956
"Some hikers saw it too.

55
00:03:19.957 --> 00:03:22.570
And there are more mushroom monsters.

56
00:03:22.571 --> 00:03:24.937
They could take over the city!"

57
00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:29.149
"What? Where did they come from?" Roxy asked.

58
00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.822
"I don't know," the mayor said.

59
00:03:31.823 --> 00:03:35.481
"But we need to do something. Hurry, Rocket Girl.

60
00:03:35.482 --> 00:03:39.612
There's a fungus among us—and it's dangerous!"

61
00:03:39.613 --> 00:03:45.954
"Don't worry, Mayor. I'm on my way!"

